sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kernel Layer
    participant F as FEK
    participant L0 as L0 Identity
    participant L1 as L1 Transfer rules
    participant L3 as L3 Lifecycle
    participant L2 as L2 Messaging
    participant A as Audit

    K->>F: Evaluate(state change request)
    par Parallel evaluation
        F->>L0: vLEI verification
        L0-->>F: ALLOW + evidence
    and
        F->>L1: canTransfer check
        L1-->>F: ALLOW + evidence
    and
        F->>L3: Cashflow and circuit-breaker check
        L3-->>F: ALLOW + evidence
    end
    F->>L2: Assemble message (requires L0 signing identity)
    L2-->>F: ALLOW + evidence
    F->>A: Append all evidence to hash chain
    A-->>F: Anchor hash
    F-->>K: ControlDecision(ALLOW)
    Note over K: State change committed only on ALLOW
